# Reown (WalletConnect) Cloud project id, used by the "Tezos X Mobile
# (WalletConnect)" connect option. Create a project at
# https://dashboard.reown.com and copy its Project ID here.
#
# Next.js inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_*-prefixed vars into the bundle at build time, so
# a value change requires restarting `next dev`. Copy this file to `.env.local`
# (gitignored) and fill in your own id; the WC relay will not connect without
# it. Reusing the same project id as packages/mobile is fine for local testing.
# The id is a public client identifier (it ends up in any WC client bundle),
# but is kept out of this public repo to avoid quota abuse.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WC_PROJECT_ID=
